    <h1>Deriv Digit Strategy Bot (XML)</h1>
    
    <div class="instructions">
        <h3>How to use:</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Copy the XML code in the box below or click <strong>Copy XML Code</strong>.</li>
            <li>Go to <a href="https://bot.deriv.com" target="_blank">Binary Bot (bot.deriv.com)</a> or <a href="https://dbot.deriv.com" target="_blank">Deriv Bot</a>.</li>
            <li>Click the <strong>Folder icon</strong> (Load) on the top menu.</li>
            <li>Select <strong>Load XML</strong> or paste the code directly.</li>
            <li>Run the bot!</li>
        </ol>
        <p><strong>Strategy Rules:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Under Contract:</strong> Triggers entry ONLY after <strong>5 Consecutive Odd digits</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Over Contract:</strong> Triggers entry ONLY after <strong>5 Consecutive Even digits</strong>.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

